  "contract": [
    "Treat request bits as unsigned, clamp requests below8, round to four bytes plus8-byte header, check native capacity, use bins then wilderness, and clear the clamped requested payload length. Preserve native arithmetic rather than adding a signed-negative guard.",
    "On exhaustion query free-space, publish status(0,1,0,0), log original info/free values, reload the sensor-task watchdog after logging, signal manager event0x200 and repeatedly delay1000 ticks. Do not return null or substitute a trap for that path.",
    "Manager bridge reads existing volatile lifecycle.thread; null returns0, otherwise forwards thread/flags and the full32-bit RTOS result. Watchdog and lifecycle cells are existing owners."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "212 native instruction bytes accounted;208 execute. Four bytes after non-returning fatal calls at0x2d572..573 and0x2d5b0..b1 cannot execute while the stock fatal routine remains non-returning.",
